        "content": "**How the attendance percentage is counted:** attended sessions ÷ sessions held, between ${__from:date:YYYY-MM-DD}\nand ${__to:date:YYYY-MM-DD}. Late arrivals: **${late:text}**. Excused absences (approved absence requests):\n**${excused:text}**. Cancelled sessions are not counted."
